{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >///// Drill Rocket mining Action Game ! /////</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid hard rocks and obstacles and reach the goal !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get lots of ore and buy power-up items such as HP up, SPEED delay, and Ultimate Skill at the SHOP to get an advantage in the game !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are various mechanisms that will twist your brain !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turtle :\u00a0Avoid at the right time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DeadEnd : Look ahead and decide your route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BarrierMachine : Match color of gadget you are wearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper rocket goes into the mine, the more complex these mechanisms become, making the game even more difficult !\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right route and break through the 1200th wall !!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three difficulty levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Normal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard difficulty.\u00a0\u00a0Make the most of the SHOP.\u00a0 If you need, store lot energy for your Ultimate Skill and break through !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Hard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is 1600th Wall,\u00a0must collect points such as ore for each wall,\u00a0UltimateSkill energy can only be stored up to 100% (1 use),\u00a0WallSkip (checkpoint) range increased from 100 to 200 Walls, etc.\u00a0Challenging difficulty with added difficult conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Hardest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is 1600st Wall.\u00a0You will only be able to buy WallSkip in the SHOP.\u00a0Very difficult difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your preferred difficulty and enjoy the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3955800?t=1757518309","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3955800?t=1757518309","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955800/3a3ed5107a405d97c0228ee9856e68560545b019/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757518309","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955800/3a3ed5107a405d97c0228ee9856e68560545b019/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757518309","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >///// Drill Rocket mining Action Game ! /////</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid hard rocks and obstacles and reach the goal !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get lots of ore and buy power-up items such as HP up, SPEED delay, and Ultimate Skill at the SHOP to get an advantage in the game !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are various mechanisms that will twist your brain !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turtle :\u00a0Avoid at the right time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DeadEnd : Look ahead and decide your route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BarrierMachine : Match color of gadget you are wearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper rocket goes into the mine, the more complex these mechanisms become, making the game even more difficult !\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right route and break through the 1200th wall !!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three difficulty levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Normal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard difficulty.\u00a0\u00a0Make the most of the SHOP.\u00a0 If you need, store lot energy for your Ultimate Skill and break through !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Hard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is 1600th Wall,\u00a0must collect points such as ore for each wall,\u00a0UltimateSkill energy can only be stored up to 100% (1 use),\u00a0WallSkip (checkpoint) range increased from 100 to 200 Walls, etc.\u00a0Challenging difficulty with added difficult conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Hardest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is 1600st Wall.\u00a0You will only be able to buy WallSkip in the SHOP.\u00a0Very difficult difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your preferred difficulty and enjoy the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Tackle Boy"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955800/ae470e73e6bf5f5d75a2b9f943d77b35892c4612/header.jpg?t=1757518309","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Some sound effects provided : OtoLogic (https://otologic.jp)","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257184432,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184432/movie480.mp4?t=1756354327","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184432/movie_max.mp4?t=1756354327"},"name":"PV","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257184432/eda1eee93c7001da0d2a0e2479c0fc863f12dbdd/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756354327","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184432/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756354327","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184432/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1756354327"}}],"name":"321Rocket","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 MB avail